--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a47ae6b2fbf34564bb18344c47c22eea, type: 3}
  m_Name: DLG_SL0_7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: "It\u2019s the final countdown\u2026 <i>turuturuuuu.</i>"
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8726e1acf043ab7458c657ccfd002abf, type: 3}
    buttonText: "\u2026Tururututu\u2026"
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77acd59186fdd4442802d00aaf954008, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eca1355730476b6498f5c55edf9ba20c, type: 3}
  - text: Meet your first <sprite=1><b> enemy</b>, the Cactusapo! He is a <sprite=6><b><color=#43dc4c>
      GRASS TYPE</color></b> enemy with 8 health.
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a45fb2ba6b66d0248841039a01baca32, type: 3}
    buttonText: 8 health!?
    highlightID: 0
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0acb53c3023e61e4fa590489c202df11, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff76c54bea289466fad5abfb68468520, type: 3}
  - text: Yup! You can either use a regular Headbutt to deal 1 damage or wear your
      <b><color=#e3304e>FIRE helmet and deal DOUBLE DAMAGE<b></color>, since  <b><color=#e3304e><sprite=5> 
      FIRE </color></b>is strong against <sprite=6><b><color=#43dc4c>  GRASS</color><b>.
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aef12474eae64534fbef8c36a460a916, type: 3}
    buttonText: Choices!
    highlightID: 2
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eab291c8a1f9984448aa94257e3de508, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eca1355730476b6498f5c55edf9ba20c, type: 3}
  - text: Not only that, some enemies <b>speed up or slow down</b> depending on what
      Elemental Helmet you hit them with, so don't go all crazy!
    npcImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aef12474eae64534fbef8c36a460a916, type: 3}
    buttonText: Understood!
    highlightID: 2
    npcSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38d73f45af347ee45bf759933e3d4966, type: 3}
    jomaSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f0a00122d1bc44608aabe6f939b2ecf8, type: 3}
